  "description": "Blessed with a breathtaking face but cursed by low birth, Bell lives as a courtesan at the beck and call of high society.\n\nHaving witnessed the grotesque desires of countless noblemen, Bell grows intrigued by Count Enoch Benedict, a man who appears utterly flawless.\n\nWhen Bell realizes Enoch is secretly harboring depravities filthier than anyone else, he resolves to trample the count beneath his feet. Exactly as Enoch desires.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/BELLES_LILY)",
